<p>The <b>2020 Libertarian National Convention</b> was a <a href="/wiki/Libertarian_Party#National_Conventions" title="Libertarian Party">National Convention</a> of the Libertarian Party. Delegates were selected by the state affiliates. Business included nomination of the LP's national ticket, amendments to the LP's bylaws, and election of members to internal positions. The in-person component of this event also included speaker sessions, meal events, and an exhibition hall. 
</p>
