<td>former <b>Presiding Judge of the Superior Court of Orange County, California</b><br /> <span style="font-size:88%"> 2012 Libertarian nominee for Vice-President </span></td>
<td>California</td>
<td><a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external text" href="https://graysharpe2020.com/">website</a></td>
<td>13 April 2020<sup id="cite_ref-3" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-3">&#91;3&#93;</a></sup>
</td></tr>
